# Voter-Controlled Final Confirmation & Polling Officer Audit System

This implements the 5-layer offline voting security architecture you described, transforming the current single-step `CastOfflineVote.jsx` flow into a proper **dual-screen voter-confirmed voting pipeline** with a full **officer audit trail** and **admin monitoring dashboard**.

---

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> The current flow lets the officer cast the final vote with a simple `window.confirm()` dialog — there is **zero voter agency**. This plan replaces it entirely with a proper voter-controlled confirmation system.

> [!WARNING]
> The Vote model and officer controller will be extended. Existing offline votes already in the database are not affected (backward-compatible schema additions only).

