## Architecture Overview

```
Officer Screen (officer portal)          Voter Screen (opens in new tab)
─────────────────────────────────        ────────────────────────────────
1. Search voter by Voter ID              (waiting)
2. Face verification via webcam          (waiting)
3. Select candidate on officer screen    (waiting)
4. Click "Send to Voter Screen" ──────►  5. Shows VOTE CONFIRMATION
   [Waiting for Voter Confirmation]          [ Party Logo ]
                                             [ CHANGE ]  [ FINAL CONFIRM ]
                                         6a. CHANGE → back to officer screen
                                         6b. FINAL CONFIRM → vote locked
7. Officer sees "VOTE LOCKED" status ◄── 7. Shows digital receipt
8. Admin sees audit trail entry
```

**Security Properties:**
1. Officer **cannot** press Final Confirm — only the voter can
2. Every action is timestamped in the `VoteAuditLog` model
3. Officers with high "change rates" are flagged in the admin dashboard
4. Vote session expires if abandoned

