### Frontend — New Voter Confirmation Screen

#### [NEW] VoterConfirmation.jsx
`client/src/pages/officer/VoterConfirmation.jsx`

This is the **voter-facing screen** opened in a new tab/window. It:
- Reads `sessionId` from the URL query string (e.g. `/officer/voter-confirm?session=abc123`)
- Polls `GET /officer/session/:sessionId` every 2s for current candidate selection
- Shows the large, beautiful confirmation UI:
  - Party logo / candidate photo
  - Candidate name + party name
  - 30-second countdown timer
  - `[ CHANGE VOTE ]` (amber) + `[ FINAL CONFIRM MY VOTE ]` (green) buttons
- On CHANGE: calls `POST /officer/session/change`, shows "Officer is reselecting..." state
- On FINAL CONFIRM: calls `POST /officer/session/confirm`, shows digital receipt

