## Verification Plan

### Manual Verification
1. Officer searches voter → face verifies → selects candidate → sends to voter screen
2. Voter screen opens in new tab, shows confirmation with 30s timer
3. Voter presses CHANGE → officer screen shows "re-select" state
4. Officer re-selects → voter screen updates with new candidate
5. Voter presses FINAL CONFIRM → vote is locked; receipt shows on voter screen
6. Officer screen shows "Vote Locked ✅ Receipt ID: VOTE-XXXX"
7. Admin officer audit page shows the session with full timeline + change rate stats
8. Verify no double-vote possible (existing `hasVoted` check + unique index on Vote)

### Automated
- Existing server routes and DB integrity constraints are preserved
- The `voteSchema` unique index `{ voterId, electionId }` still prevents double voting
